#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""One-shot, offline-runnable Step5d autotuner XY no-contact diagnostic slice.

The slice deliberately has no RTDE/network/controller implementation.  The
owner can provide the small ``DiagnosticTransport`` protocol later.  The
default CLI uses ``OfflineDiagnosticTransport`` and writes a complete
diagnostic evidence bundle without contacting a robot.

The trajectory and path-guard calculations are pure.  Contact/search/force
control/model/candidate/qualification/promotion/tell_exact are not imported
or activated by this module.
"""

